[sub_resource type="GDScript" id="GDScript_1th4y"]
script/source = "extends Node


func _ready():
	pass
	\"\"\"
	I am no warrior, and I will never fight again
	35
	-Comedy Action show, not meant to be taken seriously
	-Insane power
	-Insane wealth
	-Literal wishes
	-Bored gods
	
	-enemies to lovers
	-6/10 tournament of power fighters were villains
	-goku confirms that he puts earth in danger
	-he comes back for 24 hours and spawns a monster
	-goku misses the birth of his son purposefully
	
	-his actions eventually jeopordize worlds and universes
	-indomitable human spirit
	-infectious nature
	-'keep fighting' mentality
	-evolving into his final form 'no thoguhts, head empty'
	
	-most inexcusable part of dragonball: vegeta
	-archetype that spawned many of the most controvertial characters in anime eg bakugo and sasuke
	-lancer-type character, often goku's right hand and last defense before the fight is at its most dire
	-also, the second villain of Z, first major because no remembers Nappa and Raditz
	-his first actions are to kill his subordinate, try to blow up the earth, and the crawl away in defeat
	
	-comes back on namek, commits more brutalities and then dies while crying about sayian pride
	-what is sayian pride?
	-he bought, sold, and drank the jingoist juice of his nation
	-he was also the prince of a warrior race that was put under the foot of a cruel dictator
	-his whole world was power and conquest, then he hit earth
	
	-vegeta gets revived, kinda by accident
	-unexpectedly, he starts to settle down
	-someone from the future confirms that he gets with bulma
	-in the distant future, he would take his kid to a theme park
	-he fights a god to protect his wife
	
	-the best and the worst of vegeta come in the buu saga
	-after being unable to fight against goku for 7 years, he signs up for the same tournament as him
	-to show he is serious, he murders a swath of spectators, ignoring babidi and buu (who i swear are real and big threats)
	-later he sacrifices himself, giving a speech about how he has changed
	-is this just baiting the audience with the goku vs vegeta match? probably, but the concept is very interesting a vacuum
	
	-vegeta is a very cleary supposed to be a bad guy turned good, like the androids or picollo
	-unlike the rest though, you can feel his struggle with it, power is all he has known, his old life is dying
	-vegeta, prince of saiyans, is dead on an alien planet
	-who he used to be loathes who he has become, so he relapses
	-like anyone who has changed so radically, its not a straight line, he misses the fight.
	
	-After goku's kid beats Cell while he watches from the sidelines
	-After Vegeta watches his son get shot by this monster and must be saved from his own weakness
	-After Goku sacrifices himself to save the planet he now cares about 
	-After everyone leaves, Vegeta flies off by himself, accepting that he has lost in every way that matters.
	-He says \"I am no warrior, and I will never fight again\"
	
	
	\"\"\"
"

